OL,3,GNEWSAArgentina-bound seabird found in
OL,4,Alandlocked county
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young seabird bound for Argentina has
OL,7,Fbeen found "grounded and exhausted" in
OL,8,Fa landlocked county, more than a
OL,9,Fhundred miles from home.
OL,11,FThe Manx shearwater was spotted making
OL,12,Fa noise in a garden in Crick,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, on Friday.
OL,15,FThe homeowners called staff at
OL,16,FLeicestershire Wildlife Hospital, based
OL,17,Fin Kibworth Beauchamp, who first
OL,18,Foffered help and advice on the phone
OL,19,Fbefore collecting the bird for
OL,20,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
